{"id": "10490", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=10490", "title": "Eastman (Quebec)", "text": "Eastman is a municipality of about 1,700 people (2011) in Quebec's Eastern Townships famous for its resort spa of the same name.\nGet in.\nBy bus.\nLimocar has two direct buses a day to Eastman (3hr, $35) from Montreal's Gare d'autocars. It also has five buses a day to Bromont's Autoparc 74 (1 hr, $24). From Bromont, Limocar has two direct buses a day to Eastman (35 min, $16), and other possibilities that require a change at Sherbrooke.\nBy car.\nEastman is 115 km SE of Montreal along Autoroute 10.\nGet around.\nThe nearest taxi companies are in Magog."}
